examples DelveTalk 1
case two voices survive a cutting and a return
law moss iris
as moss
send plant
  seed: A bell for lost moths
  colour: amber
expect committed
as moss
send rain
  id (Nat): 1
  line: Both voices are mine.
expect refusal: source refused: Rain needs a different participant; leave this seed for another gardener.
as iris
send rain
  id (Nat): 1
  line: Every drop remembers a lost star.
expect committed
as iris
send cutting
  id (Nat): 1
  colour: violet
expect committed
as moss
send rain
  id (Nat): 2
  line: The old bell learns a second song.
expect committed
as iris
send visit
  id (Nat): 1
expect committed
